msgid "WebUI configuration for picoclaw. Saving this page (Save & Apply) restarts the service; do not edit this section during a long-running operation unless you have first set autostart off."
msgstr "picoclaw WebUI 配置。点击“保存并应用”后服务会重启；除非已先关闭开机自启，否则请勿在服务长时间运行期间编辑本节。"

msgid "Start the picoclaw-webui service at boot. When you save this page the service is restarted automatically."
msgstr "开机时启动 picoclaw-webui 服务。保存本页后服务会自动重启。"

msgid "picoclaw-webui.log (default)"
msgstr "picoclaw-webui.log（默认）"

msgid "Where to read logs from when the user opens the Logs tab. Setting this to `syslog` mixes picoclaw output with other system logs."
msgstr "打开“日志”页面时读取日志的位置。设为 `syslog` 会将 picoclaw 输出与其他系统日志混在一起。"

msgid "placeholder launcher, not the real picoclaw"
msgstr "占位启动器（非真正的 picoclaw）"

msgid "loopback only, not reachable from the LAN"
msgstr "仅监听本机地址，局域网无法访问"

msgid "not listening"
msgstr "未监听"

msgid "Backend"
msgstr "后端"

msgid "rpcd (luci.picoclaw)"
msgstr "rpcd (luci.picoclaw)"

msgid "in-process fallback"
msgstr "进程内回退"

msgid "The rpcd object luci.picoclaw is unavailable, using the in-process backend instead"
msgstr "rpcd 对象 luci.picoclaw 不可用，改用进程内后端"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "running"
msgstr "运行中"

msgid "stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

msgid "disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "TCP port the launcher binds (passed as -port). Must be 1..65535."
msgstr "启动器监听的 TCP 端口（以 -port 传入），范围 1..65535。"

msgid "Extra arguments"
msgstr "额外参数"

msgid "Extra launcher options, passed as separate arguments (split on spaces, no shell quoting, flags before the config file). `-no-browser -public` is what picoclaw-launcher needs to serve on the LAN instead of 127.0.0.1; other useful flags: `-d` (debug), `-lang zh`, `-host <addr>`, `-console`. Clear this field for launchers that do not know these flags."
msgstr "传给启动器的额外选项（按空格拆成独立参数，不经 shell 解析；flag 必须排在配置文件参数之前）。`-no-browser -public` 是 picoclaw-launcher 监听局域网地址（而不是仅 127.0.0.1）所必需的；其他常用参数：`-d`（调试）、`-lang zh`、`-host <addr>`、`-console`。若启动器不识别这些参数，请清空本字段。"

msgid "Launcher config file"
msgstr "启动器配置文件"

msgid "Absolute path to picoclaw's own JSON configuration file, passed to the launcher as its positional config argument. Leave empty for the launcher default (~/.picoclaw/config.json) - never point this at /etc/config/picoclaw, which is UCI, not JSON."
msgstr "picoclaw 自身 JSON 配置文件的绝对路径，作为最后一个位置参数传给启动器。留空则使用启动器默认值（~/.picoclaw/config.json）。切勿指向 /etc/config/picoclaw——那是 UCI，不是 JSON。"

msgid "2 and 3 start the launcher with -d/debug; 0 and 1 do not. (Also exported as PICOCLAW_VERBOSITY for launchers that read it.)"
msgstr "2 和 3 会以 -d/debug 启动启动器，0 和 1 不会。（同时导出为 PICOCLAW_VERBOSITY，供读取该变量的启动器使用。）"
